{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23424","headline":"秋游平泉赠韦处士闲禅师 · 白居易","name":"秋游平泉赠韦处士闲禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋景引闲步，山游不知疲。\n杖藜舍舆马，十里与僧期。\n昔尝忧六十，四体不支持。\n今来已及此，犹未苦衰羸。\n心兴遇境发，身力因行知。\n寻云到起处，爱泉听滴时。\n南村韦处士，西寺闲禅师。\n山头与涧底，闻健且相随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}